WEBVTT

00:18.028 --> 00:18.248
Oh.

01:03.042 --> 01:10.309
The darkest hour is heavy and cold The final

01:10.409 --> 01:17.975
chapter of the story we told The dashboard fades

01:18.415 --> 01:26.262
from green to grey The neon signs are washing

01:26.502 --> 01:34.767
away Now we say to dawn The night is breaking and

01:34.807 --> 01:40.833
the ghosts are gone Keep the engine running,

01:40.873 --> 01:46.138
keep the rhythm drawn We made it through the dark

01:46.639 --> 01:49.121
Now we say to dawn

01:55.165 --> 02:03.589
There is a crack in the velvet sky A silver lining

02:03.689 --> 02:10.632
bleeding into the eye The tires hum a steady,

02:11.032 --> 02:21.976
tired song We held the line all night long Fade to

02:21.996 --> 02:28.460
dawn The night is breaking and the ghosts are

02:28.480 --> 02:34.323
gone Keep the engine running, keep the rhythm

02:34.383 --> 02:39.986
going We made it through the dark Now we fade to

02:40.046 --> 02:40.926
dawn

02:47.309 --> 02:54.568
The pressure drops The signal stops The shadows

02:55.489 --> 02:58.950
run. Here comes the sun.

03:51.162 --> 03:58.426
Fade to dawn The night is breaking and the ghosts

03:58.586 --> 04:04.567
are gone Keep the engine running Keep the rhythm

04:04.607 --> 04:10.171
drawn We made it through the dark Now we fade to

04:10.231 --> 04:14.454
dawn

04:14.514 --> 04:21.419
We made it through the dark

04:22.420 --> 04:23.440
Fade to dawn

04:30.979 --> 04:31.240
Bye!

